# Build context for the Dockerfile. Adapted from Porch .dockerignore (Apache-2.0, same author).
# Allowlist: everything is excluded unless re-included below, so local secrets, databases, KEK files, real samples and
# VCS metadata never reach an image layer or the build cache.
*

!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/
!internal/
!web/
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!deploy/wagenpulse.container.yaml

# Frontend: dependencies and build output are produced inside the build, never copied from the host.
web/node_modules/
web/test-results/
web/playwright-report/
web/blob-report/
web/e2e/.auth/
internal/webui/dist/

# Never part of an image, even inside an allowlisted directory.
bin/
data/
.git/
testdata/local/
**/*.kek
**/kek
**/dev-kek
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/*_test.go
**/.DS_Store
